sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio Ingress Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant QP as Knative Queue-Proxy<br/>8012/TCP mTLS
    participant Caikit as Caikit Runtime<br/>(transformer-container)<br/>8080/TCP mTLS
    participant TGIS as TGIS Server<br/>(kserve-container)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC loopback
    participant Disk as Model Artifacts<br/>/mnt/models

    Note over Client,Disk: Flow 1: LLM Inference Request (HTTP)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (optional)
    Gateway->>QP: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8012, Istio mTLS<br/>Auth: PeerAuthentication
    QP->>Caikit: Forward to transformer-container<br/>HTTP/8080, Istio mTLS<br/>Auth: PeerAuthentication
    Caikit->>TGIS: Translate to TGIS gRPC call<br/>gRPC/8033, plaintext (localhost)<br/>Auth: None
    TGIS->>Disk: Load model weights<br/>File I/O
    Disk-->>TGIS: Model artifacts
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Generation result (gRPC response)
    Caikit-->>QP: JSON response (Caikit API format)
    QP-->>Gateway: Forward response
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,Disk: Flow 1b: Streaming Text Generation

    Client->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/task/server-streaming-text-generation<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>QP: Forward (mTLS)
    QP->>Caikit: Forward (mTLS)
    Caikit->>TGIS: Streaming gRPC call (localhost:8033)
    loop Token-by-token streaming
        TGIS-->>Caikit: Stream token (gRPC stream)
        Caikit-->>QP: SSE chunk
        QP-->>Gateway: SSE chunk
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk
    end

    Note over Client,Disk: Flow 2: Model Conversion (Development)

    participant User as Developer
    participant Convert as convert.py CLI
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    User->>Convert: Run conversion command
    Convert->>HF: Download model<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: API token (optional)
    HF-->>Convert: Model files
    Convert->>FS: Write Caikit-format model
    FS-->>Convert: Success
    Convert-->>User: Conversion complete

    Note over Client,Disk: Startup Sequence

    participant StorageInit as KServe Storage Initializer<br/>(init-container)
    participant S3 as Model Storage<br/>(S3/PVC)

    StorageInit->>S3: Download model artifacts
    S3-->>StorageInit: Model files
    StorageInit->>Disk: Write to /mnt/models
    Note over TGIS: TGIS starts, loads model weights
    Note over Caikit: Caikit starts, test_connections: true<br/>Verifies TGIS backend on :8033
    Caikit->>TGIS: Health check (gRPC/8033)
    TGIS-->>Caikit: Backend ready
    Note over Caikit: caikit_health_probe → READY
